<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
	<head>
		<%- include('_headers') %>
		<title>Power System Experts</title>
	</head>
	<body class="">
		<header class="min-h-[100vh] w-full" id="home">
			<%- include('_nav') %>
			<!-- HERO section -->
			<section
				class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center mt-0">
				<div
					class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center h-max w-full basis-2/3 animate-on-scroll mt-10 md:mt-16">
					<h1 class="section-main-heading">
						Empowering the Future with Expertise
					</h1>
					<p
						class="font-['Montserrat'] text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-center mb-4">
						At Power System Experts, we deliver cutting-edge engineering
						solutions designed to efficiency, reliability, and innovation.
						Through comprehensive system studies, advanced dynamic modeling, and
						simulations, we optimize your power infrastructure for peak
						performance and long-term sustainability.
					</p>
					<a class="btn-primary" href="#contact"> CONTACT </a>
				</div>
				<!-- <div class="w-full h-full basis-1/3 animate-on-scroll">
					<img src="/images/hero-image.png" class="hidden md:block" alt="" />
				</div> -->
			</section>
		</header>

		<br />
		<!-- Blogs -->
		<section id="blogs">
			<div>
				<h1 class="section-main-heading mb-20 animate-on-scroll">BLOGS</h1>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
					<% articles.forEach(article=>{ %>
					<div class="blog animate-on-scroll">
						<h2><%= article.title %></h2>
						<span> <%= article.createdAt.toLocaleDateString() %> </span>
						<p><%= article.description %></p>
					</div>
					<% }) %>
				</div>
				<a class="btn-primary" href="/articles/all"> ALL Blogs </a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Services  -->
		<section class="with-bg" id="services">
			<div>
				<h1 class="section-main-heading animate-on-scroll">OUR SERVICES</h1>
				<p>
					We specialize in a wide range of power system studies and provide
					valuable services to our clients. We perform power system planning
					studies, Grid interconnection studies, Model quality and acceptance
					test studies, Substation design and insulation coordination studies,
					Protection Coordination Studies and and Operational Studies.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- List of services -->
		<section>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 justify-center items-center mt-20">
				<div class="service animate-on-scroll">
					<h2>Power System Planning</h2>
					<p>
						We offer a complete range of planning services to ensure the
						reliability, stability, and cost-efficiency of your power systems to
						help you plan for future expansions and upgrades.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-75">
					<h2>Grid Interconnection</h2>
					<p>
						We facilitate the smooth interconnection of renewable energy sources
						and other generation assets with the grid. From grid impact analysis
						to compliance with regional grid codes, our team ensures that your
						projects are approved and integrated seamlessly.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-75">
					<h2>Substation Design</h2>
					<p>
						We facilitate the smooth interconnection of renewable energy sources
						and other generation assets with the grid. From grid impact analysis
						to compliance with regional grid codes, our team ensures that your
						projects are approved and integrated seamlessly.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-150">
					<h2>Protection and Control</h2>
					<p>
						Robust protection and control solutions designed to safeguard your
						electrical assets and ensure the reliable operation of your power
						systems. Our specialized services encompass the full spectrum of
						protection and control engineering, from system design to relay
						settings, ensuring your power systems operate securely under normal
						and fault conditions.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-200">
					<h2>Operational Studies</h2>
					<p>
						At Power System Experts, we provide comprehensive operational
						studies that ensure the optimal performance and stability of your
						power systems under real-world operating conditions. Our operational
						studies are designed to enhance system reliability, improve
						efficiency, and prevent operational issues, offering valuable
						insights into system behavior during normal and emergency
						conditions.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-300">
					<h2>Capacity Building and Training</h2>
					<p>
						At Power System Experts, we are committed to advancing the skills
						and expertise of power system engineers. Through our targeted
						capacity-building programs, we offer hands-on training and advanced
						workshops designed to enhance technical knowledge in critical areas
						of power system engineering.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- About US section -->
		<section class="with-bg" id="about">
			<div>
				<h1 class="section-main-heading animate-on-scroll">About Us</h1>
				<p>
					Power System Experts is a power system engineering consultancy
					specializing in modelling, simulation, and analysis. A team of 10
					power system engineers with extensive experience, including extensive
					design of utility-scale renewable-generating systems. Our team has
					global exposure and have worked on many projects collectively within
					USA, Canada, Australia, South East Asia, the Middle East and Africa.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- About us details -->

		<section>
			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 justify-center items-center mt-20">
				<div class="service animate-on-scroll">
					<h2>Our Mission</h2>
					<p>
						Our Mission is enable our clients for establishing safer, reliable
						and cleaner power systems across the planet by providing them with
						expert advice, capacity building and innovative ways of problem
						solving.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-75">
					<h2>Our Vision</h2>
					<p>
						Our vision is to be a globally recognized power system solutions
						provider.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="service animate-on-scroll delay-150">
					<h2>Our Team</h2>
					<p>
						A team of power system engineers with a collective experience of
						over 50 years in extensive design and integration of utility scale
						renewable generating systems, system operation and planning, power
						system protection and design. Our team has global exposure and have
						worked on hundreds of projects collectively within USA, Canada,
						Australia, Europe, South East Asia, the Middle East and Africa.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Contact Us -->

		<section class="with-bg" id="contact">
			<div>
				<h1 class="section-main-heading animate-on-scroll">Contact Us</h1>
				<p>
					You can reach us by sending us an email with your request at
					contactus@psystemexp.com. Alternatively, you can fill the contact form
					below and submit so that we could reach to you in response.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- Input fields -->

		<section class="">
			<form id="contact-form" class="flex flex-col px-5">
				<div class="input-div">
					<label for="name">Name</label>
					<input
						type="text"
						name="name"
						id="name"
						placeholder="Name"
						required />
				</div>

				<div class="input-div">
					<label for="email">Your Email</label>
					<input
						type="email"
						name="email"
						id="email"
						placeholder="Example@abc.com"
						required />
				</div>

				<div class="input-div">
					<label for="message">Your Message</label>
					<textarea
						type="message"
						name="message"
						id="message"
						placeholder="Hello, I wanted to..."
						cols="30"
						rows="10"
						required>
					</textarea>
				</div>
				<div class="input-div">
					<button type="submit" id="send-message" class="btn-primary">
						Send
					</button>
				</div>
			</form>
		</section>

		<!-- Footer -->

		<%- include('_footer') %>

		<script
			type="text/javascript"
			src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@emailjs/browser@4/dist/email.min.js"></script>
		<script></script>
	</body>
	<div class="show"></div>
</html>
